{"id":"torrey:bow-the","source":"torrey","name":"Bow, The","slug":"bow-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"An instrument of war — Ge 48:22; Isa 7:24.","refs":[["Gen",48,22,48,22],["Isa",7,24,7,24]]},{"text":"Sometimes used in hunting — Ge 27:3.","refs":[["Gen",27,3,27,3]]},{"text":"For shooting arrows — 1Ch 12:2.","refs":[["1Chr",12,2,12,2]]},{"text":"Called the battle bow — Zec 9:10; 10:4.","refs":[["Zech",9,10,9,10],["Zech",10,4,10,4]]},{"text":"Bowmen. — Jer 4:29.","refs":[["Jer",4,29,4,29]]},{"text":"Archers. — 1Sa 31:3; Jer 51:3.","refs":[["1Sam",31,3,31,3],["Jer",51,3,51,3]]},{"text":"Usually of steel — 2Sa 22:35; Job 20:24.","refs":[["2Sam",22,35,22,35],["Job",20,24,20,24]]},{"text":"Held in the left hand — Eze 39:3.","refs":[["Ezek",39,3,39,3]]},{"text":"Drawn with full force — 2Ki 9:24.","refs":[["2Kgs",9,24,9,24]]},{"text":"The Jews taught to use — 2Sa 1:18.","refs":[["2Sam",1,18,1,18]]},{"text":"Lydians. — Jer 46:9.","refs":[["Jer",46,9,46,9]]},{"text":"Elamites. — Jer 49:35.","refs":[["Jer",49,35,49,35]]},{"text":"Philistines. — 1Sa 31:2,3.","refs":[["1Sam",31,2,31,2],["1Sam",31,3,31,3]]},{"text":"Sons of Reuben, Gad, and Manasseh. — 1Ch 5:18.","refs":[["1Chr",5,18,5,18]]},{"text":"Benjamites. — 1Ch 12:2; 2Ch 14:8.","refs":[["1Chr",12,2,12,2],["2Chr",14,8,14,8]]},{"text":"Given as a token of friendship — 1Sa 18:4.","refs":[["1Sam",18,4,18,4]]},{"text":"Often furnished by the state — 2Ch 26:14.","refs":[["2Chr",26,14,26,14]]},{"text":"Of the vanquished, broken and burned — Ps 37:15; Eze 39:9.","refs":[["Ps",37,15,37,15],["Ezek",39,9,39,9]]},{"text":"Of strength and power. — Job 29:20.","refs":[["Job",29,20,29,20]]},{"text":"Of the tongue of the wicked. — Ps 11:2; Jer 9:3.","refs":[["Ps",11,2,11,2],["Jer",9,3,9,3]]},{"text":"(When deceitful,) of the hypocrite. — Ps 78:57; Ho 7:16.","refs":[["Ps",78,57,78,57],["Hos",7,16,7,16]]},{"text":"(When broken,) of the overthrow of power. — 1Sa 2:4; Jer 49:35; Ho 1:5; 2:18.","refs":[["1Sam",2,4,2,4],["Jer",49,35,49,35],["Hos",1,5,1,5],["Hos",2,18,2,18]]}],"refCount":34}
